{
  "_comment": "Frame-indexed 2D particle emitters. Keyed character -> animation -> list of emitters. Each emitter: type (a scene name under particles/), mode ('sustained' emits while any listed frame is on screen; 'burst' spawns a one-shot each time a listed frame is entered), frames (SHEET-relative indices, same numbering as the generator's loop_from/hit_frames; the idle-reference frame 0 counts), pos ([x, y] pixel offset from the sprite origin at the feet, for facing right; auto-mirrored when facing left), boost (optional intensity MULTIPLIERS on the scene's own values so one type can be reused at different power levels: amount, speed, scale, lifetime; plus explosiveness which is absolute 0-1). clip_to_ground (optional bool on a burst: clamp its rectangular emission band and hitbox to the edges of the platform directly underfoot, so a ground blast doesn't spill past the ledge into open air).",
